## Project Overview

This repository documents an end-to-end Security Operations Center (SOC) detection engineering and automated incident response lab. Using a three-node virtualized environment, an automated HTTP POST credential brute-force attack was launched against a containerized web application, analyzed through raw server error telemetry, detected via custom correlation rules in **Wazuh SIEM**, and automatically contained using **Wazuh Active Response (`firewall-drop`)**.

📄 **[Read the Full 40-Page Technical Lab Report (PDF)](./report/Wazuh-DVWA-Brute-Force-Detection-Report.pdf)**

